      "start_seconds": 244.44,
      "end_seconds": 272.39,
      "duration_seconds": 27.95,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a pleural effusion needing a cause is my leading thought, not anything worse i think a pleural fluid sample makes sense here, for pleural effusion i think a chest X-ray makes sense here, for breathlessness i am arranging an urgent chest clinic review the chest clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you"
