      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.72,
      "end_seconds": 293.0,
      "duration_seconds": 11.28,
      "text": "If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about a CT scan of the chest, but not now. Let's plan a check after the scan."
